@title: VERIFY keeps numbers whole, and does not count text nobody sees
# VERIFY that 'Cart: 1' is present passed on "Cart: 10", and 'hex' on Allo's
# swatches, where it is drawn at font-size 0.
STEP 1: Numbers
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/words.html
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 1' is NOT present
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 10' is present
    VERIFY that 'Workshop at 10' is present
STEP 2: Text drawn at font-size 0
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/swatches.html
    VERIFY that 'hex' is NOT present
    VERIFY that 'gradient' is NOT present
    VERIFY that '4.9 218' is present
    VERIFY that 'One' is present
DONE.
